  description: '3 Effect Monsters

    Must be Link Summoned. All face-up monsters
    on the field are changed to Defense Position. Unaffected by the activated effects
    of Defense Position monsters. Once per turn, if this card is in the Extra Monster
    Zone: You can target 1 Level 3 "Scareclaw" monster in your GY; Special Summon
    it, and if you do, add 1 "Scareclaw" monster from your Deck to your hand, also
    you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except "Scareclaw"
    monsters.'
